{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7vil3ykc","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":60,"title":"Schick!","nativeTitle":"Stylish!","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Inge","Nico","Selma"],"speakerGenders":{"Inge":"female","Nico":"male","Selma":"female"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Hallo, junger Mann. Wo kommst du denn jetzt her ?","native":"Hello, young man. Where are you coming from now?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich war draußen. Ich hab meine Tasche gefunden.","native":"I was outside. I found my bag."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Hat die Polizei deine Tasche gefunden?","native":"Did the police find your bag?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Nein, Selma.","native":"No, Selma."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Oho, wer ist denn Selma?","native":"Oho, and who is Selma?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Niemand …","native":"Nobody …"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Komm mal mit. Ich hab eine tolle Überraschung für dich.","native":"Come with me. I have a great surprise for you."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Eine Überraschung? Was?","native":"A surprise? What?"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Das sind Sachen von Günther. Günther war mein Mann. Er lebt nicht mehr . Er hat immer sehr elegante Kleidung getragen. Alles ist so gut wie neu. Schau mal, dieses schicke Hemd! Und die braune Hose steht dir sicher sehr gut.","native":"These are Günther's things. Günther was my husband. He's no longer alive. He always wore very elegant clothes. Everything is as good as new. Look, this stylish shirt! And the brown pants will surely look very good on you."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Sieht bequem aus.","native":"Looks comfortable."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Na los, probier die Sachen an! Ich finde, du bist ein hübscher junger Mann! Das steht dir ganz toll. Sehr elegant. Ein gestreiftes Hemd und eine warme Hose und ganz schicke Schuhe!","native":"Come on, try the things on! I think you're a handsome young 